                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">High Performance</span>
                        <button onclick="openServiceModal('Database Optimization & Architecture', 'Eliminate performance bottlenecks with expert database indexing, query profiling, sharding architectures, and real-time clustering across PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, and distributed SQL engines.')" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
